1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:14,680
How to use the TEG study cost price list – and install the Talented app on your phone

2
00:00:15,280 --> 00:00:29,830
Open the price list page and pick your language at the top right – 8 languages are available.

3
00:00:30,430 --> 00:00:41,710
The menu: study programmes, English, pathways, other schools, VSA courses, jobs, accommodation and start your application.

4
00:00:42,310 --> 00:00:53,860
Choose Australia or New Zealand, then Offshore (still in Indonesia) or Onshore (already there).

5
00:00:54,460 --> 00:01:05,840
Search by course or school, then filter by city, field, level and maximum upfront cost.

6
00:01:06,440 --> 00:01:13,810
Pick your OSHC provider – insurance costs are recalculated for every result.

7
00:01:14,410 --> 00:01:25,240
Sort by cheapest, upfront cost, total study cost, recommended bank balance, A–Z or duration.

8
00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:36,640
Each card shows upfront cost, total study cost and recommended bank balance, with an IDR estimate.

9
00:01:37,240 --> 00:01:47,900
Open Programme details to see tuition per period, material and enrolment fees, and the upfront periods.

10
00:01:48,500 --> 00:02:00,460
Upfront cost, minimum bank balance for the visa, and a refund policy summary with its official source.

11
00:02:01,060 --> 00:02:12,490
Download a PDF or send it to WhatsApp; Start your application and Ask a consultant are on every card.

12
00:02:13,090 --> 00:02:24,450
Tick Compare on two or more programmes, then click Compare selected programmes.

13
00:02:25,050 --> 00:02:37,800
Save all results as a PDF, only your ticked programmes, or send the list to WhatsApp.

14
00:02:38,400 --> 00:02:50,999
English (ELICOS) shows weekly course fees; a consultant calculates the upfront cost for your number of weeks.

15
00:02:51,600 --> 00:03:00,890
Pathway packages: VET at one school, then a Bachelor at another; each school issues its own CoE.

16
00:03:01,490 --> 00:03:08,670
Other schools links to the official CRICOS directory to check registered schools.

17
00:03:09,270 --> 00:03:28,760
English courses (VSA): Basic English, PTE Foundation and IELTS/PTE Preparation, online and offline, priced in IDR.

18
00:03:29,360 --> 00:03:50,680
Jobs: listings from Jobs by Adzuna, checked daily, with official visa work-hour rules. Never pay to get a job.

19
00:03:51,280 --> 00:04:08,660
Accommodation: a directory of student housing providers. Never transfer money before an official contract.

20
00:04:09,260 --> 00:04:28,010
Start your application: document checklist, process steps and the Student Information Form (PDF/Excel).

21
00:04:28,610 --> 00:04:41,240
Part 2: install the Talented app on your phone – free, no Play Store or App Store needed.

22
00:04:41,840 --> 00:04:48,950
Open the price list on your phone and tap "Mobile App Talented" at the top.

23
00:04:49,550 --> 00:05:07,340
Android: in Chrome tap Install, or use the three-dot menu → "Install app" / "Add to Home screen".

24
00:05:07,940 --> 00:05:21,860
iPhone/iPad: in Safari tap Share → "Add to Home Screen" → "Add".

25
00:05:22,460 --> 00:05:33,790
Done! The Talented icon is now on your home screen.

26
00:05:34,390 --> 00:05:48,630
All prices are estimates; final amounts follow the school's official offer letter.
